    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Chicken Wings\"\n  servings: 3\n  prep_time: \"22 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"86 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"1 tsp bread\"\n    \"2 tbsp farmed prawns\"\n    \"2 oz sprouts\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"Baked milk-stuffed ostrich, seasoned with achiote seed and crispy herbs, accompanied by roasted kale medley.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of bitter rhubarb, complemented by sultana and cumin.\"\n    \"A special magenta leeks from Kyrgyz Republic. To support the strong flavor it is sided with a tablespoon of ginger.\"\n    \"Grilled salmon kebabs, marinated in Sri Lankan spices and served with a fresh radish and date salad.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of salty endive, complemented by bush tomato and annatto seed.\"\n    \"Juicy pigeon, grilled to your liking and drizzled with a bold lavender sauce, served alongside roasted iceberg lettuce.\"\n    \"Fresh haloumi with a pinch of marjoram, topped by a caramelized papaw with whipped cream\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 468\n    protein: \"37g\"\n    carbs: \"25g\"\n    fat: \"6g\"\n  }\n}"
  }
